    "detailed_description": "\u25c6 Knead the dough. Roll out the dough. Every detail, from the stretching and rising of dough to the splashing of sauces and melting of cheese, is finely crafted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Here is your fully equipped kitchen. Customize your cozy apartment to reflect your unique style and taste. It's your safe space to relax and enjoy while learning to make delicious pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/955119aa366df2ea4032dec9653581a9.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 The game boasts highly realistic object physics, enabling interaction with ingredients and kitchen tools just as in real life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Embark on your culinary journey and level up your character\u2019s skills and perks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/7f551ad6ed52fc47b450a98bd222050b.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 Cut any ingredients into pieces of any size at different angles. We have implemented the cutting to be as realistic as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Choose ingredients to your taste or according to real-life recipes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/78332b5496245c2919192cced83d994e.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 The cooking mechanics are meticulously designed, challenging you to master techniques like kneading, slicing, and baking to create the perfect pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u25c6 Knead the dough. Roll out the dough. Every detail, from the stretching and rising of dough to the splashing of sauces and melting of cheese, is finely crafted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/e94621cd69ad5ce4701ece3259ce3541.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Here is your fully equipped kitchen. Customize your cozy apartment to reflect your unique style and taste. It's your safe space to relax and enjoy while learning to make delicious pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/955119aa366df2ea4032dec9653581a9.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 The game boasts highly realistic object physics, enabling interaction with ingredients and kitchen tools just as in real life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/c3250dae5fb06fe82044526c00527497.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Embark on your culinary journey and level up your character\u2019s skills and perks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/7f551ad6ed52fc47b450a98bd222050b.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 Cut any ingredients into pieces of any size at different angles. We have implemented the cutting to be as realistic as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/81a986634bbeb73c02a66144f4edc9f9.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Choose ingredients to your taste or according to real-life recipes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/78332b5496245c2919192cced83d994e.avif?t=1745317053\" /></span><br><br>\u25c6 The cooking mechanics are meticulously designed, challenging you to master techniques like kneading, slicing, and baking to create the perfect pizza.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.poster.avif?t=1745317053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.webm?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554880/extras/affa576b2fec1ae14120fd33e729e322.mp4?t=1745317053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Extremely realistic cooking simulator. Experience life as a true chef in this cozy game. Work in a stylish apartment, cook delicious pizzas using real-life recipes. Select various ingredients, perfect your techniques, and immerse yourself in the process. Become the best pizzaiolo!",
